message: "If you use this software or its analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Forecasting and reconstructing monthly methane and carbon dioxide flux at Marcell Bog Lake Peatland"
abstract: >-
  A study of monthly methane and carbon dioxide flux at AmeriFlux US-MBP,
  comparing statistical and machine learning forecasts against seasonal
  benchmarks at horizons of one to twelve months, and projecting fitted
  relationships backward into the two decades before measurement began.
type: software
